{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Water 是一款以真實流體表面為亮點的飲水追蹤器，畫面會隨著手機傾斜而流動，每次記錄喝水都會泛起漣漪。它適合鍾愛簡潔、不想被複雜功能干擾的用家，透過一目了然的玻璃杯與智能提醒，讓你專注於每日喝水目標。原價 US $2.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>一按記錄與自訂水量設定讓補充水分更直接；智能提醒會按尚欠水量溫和通知。日誌按日分組，可滑動刪除，月曆圓環呈現持續記錄。支援毫升與安士單位，輸入年齡、身高和體重後會建立更貼身的每日目標；配合 Liquid Glass 按鈕、觸覺回饋與順滑動畫，操作體驗細緻流暢。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-166-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-167-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-168-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-169-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Water – Hydration Reminder</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T14:42:20.249713+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}